#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Miki"
msgid "I've got my confidence back, thanks to you."
msgstr "Recupere la confianza en mí misma, gracias a ti."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm happy to hear that."
msgstr "Me alegra oír eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Miki"
msgid "I think I'll send that Taniguchi a message."
msgstr "Le enviaré a Taniguchi un mensaje."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "What, right now?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Ahora mismo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Miki"
msgid "Uh-huh. I've got to get that newly hatched hunk away from\\r\nthat other hostess."
msgstr "Ajá. Tengo que alejar a ese galán recién nacido de\\r\naquella otra hostess."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah. Well, I won't try to stop you..."
msgstr "Ah. Bueno, no voy a detenerte..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Taniguchi"
msgid "Miki! It's been so long!"
msgstr "¡Miki! ¡Cuanto tiempo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Miki"
msgid "Didn't you get a huge makeover?"
msgstr "¿No te habías hecho un cambio de imagen?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Taniguchi"
msgid "You heard about that? I guess Akiyama-san must've told you,\\r\nhuh?"
msgstr "¿Supiste sobre eso? Seguro que Akiyama-san,\\r\nte lo habrá contado, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Miki"
msgid "Akiyama-san?"
msgstr "¿Akiyama-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "No, no. Miki saw you walking around with your new look－and\\r\nanother hostess."
msgstr "No, no. Miki te vio caminando por ahí con tu nuevo look - y\\r\ncon otra hostess."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Taniguchi"
msgid "Oh, right... Well, I did have more girls coming after me\\r\nonce I changed my image, but we never lasted longer than\\r\na date or two."
msgstr "Ah, eso... Bueno, si había otras mujeres que iban detrás de mi\\r\ncuando cambie mi imagen, pero nunca duraban más que una\\r\ncita o dos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Taniguchi"
msgid "I felt like I wasn't myself, like I was living a lie... I\\r\nguess even the best makeover in the world is really only skin-deep."
msgstr "Sentía que no era yo mismo, como si estuviera viviendo una mentira...\\r\nSupongo que ni la mejor transformación del mundo\\r\ncambia a una persona en el fondo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Taniguchi"
msgid "I eventually came to accept that this is the best style for\\r\nme after all."
msgstr "Eventualmente, termine aceptando que este es el mejor estilo\\r\npara mí, después de todo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Miki"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Taniguchi"
msgid "That's when I got your message, Miki, and now here I am."
msgstr "Fue entonces cuando recibí tu mensaje, Miki, y ahora aquí estoy."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Miki"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Taniguchi"
msgid "I'm so sorry. You must've really missed me. But I won't\\r\nstray again. See you at the club!"
msgstr "Lo siento mucho. Seguro que me has extrañado mucho. Pero\\r\nno desapareceré de nuevo. ¡Te veo en el club!"
